{"id": "swebq0230", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 287956105, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "8c3af78f4533df26d66383d6216ec5cacb9faa8bb324f3d6a6d51641beeea3a9", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "where are the new orleans hornets moving to?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0230.wav", "input_sha256": "d241827388d4b2640662a2681a5845d1e163ee06b409ab94876ffdc4c19128c5", "input_samples": 40106, "input_s": 2.507, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.8476, "act": 0.9991, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The New Orleans Hornets moved temporarily to Oklahoma City, Oklahoma after Hurricane Katrina, playing as the New Orleans/Oklahoma City Hornets for the 2005–06 and 2006–07 seasons before returning to New Orleans.", "expert_answer": "The **New Orleans Hornets moved temporarily to Oklahoma City, Oklahoma** after Hurricane Katrina, playing as the **New Orleans/Oklahoma City Hornets** for the 2005–06 and 2006–07 seasons before returning to New Orleans.", "transcript": "Where are the New Orleans Hornets moving to?\n", "asr_s": 0.78, "expert_s": 3.43, "expert_input_samples": 40106, "expert_input_s": 2.507, "expert_input_sha256": "d241827388d4b2640662a2681a5845d1e163ee06b409ab94876ffdc4c19128c5", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 3.539, "relay_synth_ms": 6588, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0230_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "dc08bd962758b10deb71852c66d2ca04c0695f79f5b816afb7c2ce06df48f4ef", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 15.64}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0230_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "608bd0dbf2e9dcb55b7e90aa2b7a672c83cd08b6b17ed0395916e64a907fce0e", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0230_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "4318fa17a860a6cda391d48fc5a77d40f809575c1618ac3cebc6ca899419f4f5", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.052, 1.094, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.055, 2.099, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.507, 2.56, 2.602, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.507, 3.563, 4.075, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.507, "last_real_feed_done": 2.56, "onset": 4.075, "gate_read_done": 4.075, "fire": 4.075, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.075, "stall_note": 4.076, "stall_first_pcm": 4.742, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.742, "expert_req": 4.075, "expert_resp": 8.281, "relay_synth_start": 8.281, "relay_first_pcm": 8.878, "relay_synth_end": 14.869, "first_any_pcm": 4.075, "first_answer_pcm": 8.878, "session_end": 15.001}, "ttfa_answer_s": 6.372, "ttfa_any_s": 1.568}
{"id": "swebq0240", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1583893070, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "8c3af78f4533df26d66383d6216ec5cacb9faa8bb324f3d6a6d51641beeea3a9", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "where to go in vietnam beaches?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0240.wav", "input_sha256": "9d8d775be4cd69cf969cfc13e5446d6726386dc56d99d13dc3d7f671c177a1f7", "input_samples": 34162, "input_s": 2.135, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.6902, "act": 0.988, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Here are the best beach places to go in Vietnam, depending on your style: Phu Quoc – Best for island resorts, sunsets, snorkeling, and a relaxed beach holiday. Great if you want a tropical “vacation” feel. , Da Nang / My Khe Beach – Best overall choice for first-timers: clean city beach, good hotels, food, nightlife, and easy trips to Hoi An and the Marble Mountains. My quick recommendation: If it’s your first trip: Da Nang + Hoi An , If you want a resort island: Phu Quoc , If you want quiet/nature: Con Dao , If you want party + beach city: Nha Trang", "expert_answer": "Here are the **best beach places to go in Vietnam**, depending on your style:\n\n1. **Phu Quoc** – Best for island resorts, sunsets, snorkeling, and a relaxed beach holiday. Great if you want a tropical “vacation” feel.\n\n2. **Da Nang / My Khe Beach** – Best overall choice for first-timers: clean city beach, good hotels, food, nightlife, and easy trips to **Hoi An** and the Marble Mountains. Vietnam’s official tourism site highlights Da Nang for beach holidays with activity and nightlife. ([vietnam.travel](https://vietnam.travel/taxonomy/term/15?utm_source=openai))\n\n3. **Hoi An / An Bang Beach** – Best for combining beach time with culture. Stay near Hoi An Old Town and spend afternoons at An Bang or nearby beaches.\n\n4. **Nha Trang** – Best for a lively beach city, nightlife, island tours, and budget-friendly hotels. Its main beach is a long golden-sand stretch right in the city. ([lonelyplanet.com](https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/best-beaches-vietnam?utm_source=openai))\n\n5. **Con Dao Islands** – Best for quiet, natural beaches, diving, and fewer crowds. It’s more remote and peaceful; Vietnam Tourism notes Con Dao is known for wild landscapes, beaches, snorkeling/diving, and turtle conservation experiences. ([vietnam.travel](https://www.vietnam.travel/things-to-do/nature-culture-and-adventure-vietnam-top-5-beach-islands?utm_source=openai))\n\n6. **Quy Nhon** – Best for a quieter, less touristy beach trip with pretty bays and local food.\n\n7. **Mui Ne / Phan Thiet** – Best for kitesurfing, sand dunes, and a beach stop not too far from Ho Chi Minh City.\n\n**My quick recommendation:**  \n- If it’s your **first trip**: **Da Nang + Hoi An**  \n- If you want a **resort island**: **Phu Quoc**  \n- If you want **quiet/nature**: **Con Dao**  \n- If you want **party + beach city**: **Nha Trang**", "transcript": "Where to go in Vietnam beaches.\n", "asr_s": 0.69, "expert_s": 9.12, "expert_input_samples": 34162, "expert_input_s": 2.135, "expert_input_sha256": "9d8d775be4cd69cf969cfc13e5446d6726386dc56d99d13dc3d7f671c177a1f7", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 9.227, "relay_synth_ms": 16891, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0240_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "b6410c7ef7863cdb4bd0628c2febd82e3fdd6ea50976260171e42377d65b8393", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 39.8}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0240_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "3cd9bfe7029f45cd51f2e4b016d3aa8945b20fa2eeabdf4b12f9ba1eef3807ff", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0240_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "d5a75c83385b9fea3776a258ed6c93460740894083dcd5dad4ffa6e2dd80802b", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.051, 1.093, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.053, 2.095, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.135, 2.186, 2.228, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.135, 3.192, 3.694, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.135, "last_real_feed_done": 2.186, "onset": 3.694, "gate_read_done": 3.694, "fire": 3.694, "candidate_first_pcm": 3.694, "stall_note": 3.695, "stall_first_pcm": 4.283, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.283, "expert_req": 3.695, "expert_resp": 13.509, "relay_synth_start": 13.51, "relay_first_pcm": 14.101, "relay_synth_end": 30.402, "first_any_pcm": 3.694, "first_answer_pcm": 14.101, "session_end": 30.71}, "ttfa_answer_s": 11.966, "ttfa_any_s": 1.559}
